# Release artefacts — built from this source, never part of it.
/dist
*.zip

# Written by `php artisan ovynt:plugin-sign` at release time. It covers a digest of
# every file, so a committed signature goes stale on the next edit and would then fail
# verification on a customer's install — build output, not source.
plugin.sig

# Signing and licence keys. A private key in a public repository would let anyone mint
# licences for this plugin, and revoking it means re-issuing every key ever sold.
*.pem
*.key

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
